    "name_raw": "Armored Rider",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Adventurer’s Guide",
    "definition_raw": "You are accustomed to riding while wearing armor, and your armor doesn’t hinder your riding skills.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Mounted Combat, Ride 3 ranks.\n\nBenefit(s): You don’t take the usual armor check penalty on Ride checks. If you are knocked unconscious while in a saddle, you always remain in the saddle.\n\nNormal: If you are knocked unconscious while riding, you have a 50% chance to stay in the saddle (75% if you’re in a military saddle).",
